Chapter: AgentBundleDecimal
  cites Works chapter AgentBundle

 A manifest field is `key value` on its own line. model-bytes is compared with the
 model file's size, so a value past an Integer must come back as -1, which that
 check refuses.

Section: Body

  abd-bytes : Text, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  abd-bytes (s) (i) (acc) = if i >= text-length s then acc else abd-bytes s (i + 1) (list-push acc (to-unicode (char-code (char-at s i))))

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("model-bytes 1234: " & show (ab-field-decimal (abd-bytes "model-bytes 1234" 0 [] & [10]) "model-bytes"))
    print-line-uni ("model-bytes of 25 digits: " & show (ab-field-decimal (abd-bytes "model-bytes 9999999999999999999999999" 0 [] & [10]) "model-bytes"))
    print-line-uni ("absent: " & show (ab-field-decimal (abd-bytes "name x" 0 [] & [10]) "model-bytes"))
  end
